# Headers a reputation scanner reads, and that cost nothing to serve.
#
# This file covers /assets/* only -- the fingerprinted JS and CSS bundles,
# which wrangler.jsonc excludes from run_worker_first, so the Worker never
# sees them and cannot stamp their headers. Everything else on the dashboard
# goes through worker/index.js, which sets the same three values. Cloudflare
# does not apply _headers to a Worker's own responses, so both copies are
# needed. Change one, change the other.
#
# Vite copies this directory into dist/ verbatim, which is the asset directory
# wrangler.jsonc uploads.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15552000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
